cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this skill, cite SCOP and the underlying methods (CellChat, SCENIC)."
title: "SCOP single-cell skill"
abstract: >-
  A data-agnostic collection of SCOP workflows for Seurat single-cell analysis:
  marker/gene-set heatmaps, per-gene expression figures, patient-paired
  pseudobulk statistics, cell-cell communication (CellChat), and SCENIC
  regulon inference with the pure R/C++ backend.
authors:
  - family-names: "SCOP skill contributors"
version: 1.1.0
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/your-org/scop-skill"
keywords:
  - single-cell
  - SCOP
  - Seurat
  - CellChat
  - SCENIC
  - bioinformatics
